      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the Minister must not make a determination if the\nMinister is satisfied that the person would, if the Minister were to\nmake the determination, become a person who is not a national or\ncitizen of any country.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, the Minister must not make a determination if the\nMinister is satisfied that the person would, if the Minister were to\nmake the determination, become a person who is not a national or\ncitizen of any country.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d"
