      "cml:premiseText": "(4) Subsection (1) applies to a person who is an Australian citizen",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Citizenship cessation determination for certain convictions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "36D(5) Citizenship cessation determination for certain convictions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020#sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the provisions are the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a provision of Subdivision A of Division 72 of the Criminal\nCode (explosives and lethal devices);\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 88, 2020\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020\n\n(b) a provision of Subdivision B of Division 80 of the Criminal\nCode (treason);\n\n(c) a provision of Division 82 of the Criminal Code (sabotage),\nother than section 82.9;\n\n(d) a provision of Division 91 of the Criminal Code (espionage);\n\n(e) a provision of Division 92 of the Criminal Code (foreign\ninterference);\n\n(f) a provision of Part 5.3 of the Criminal Code (terrorism),\nother than section 102.8 or Division 104 or 105;\n\n(g) a provision of Part 5.5 of the Criminal Code (foreign\nincursions and recruitment);\n\n(h) section 6 or 7 of the repealed Crimes (Foreign Incursions\nand Recruitment) Act 1978.\nNote:\nA determination may be made in relation to a conviction for an\noffence against a provision specified in subsection (5) that occurred\nbefore the subsection commenced (see item 19 of Schedule 1 to the\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the provisions are the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a provision of Subdivision A of Division 72 of the Criminal\nCode (explosives and lethal devices);\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 88, 2020\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020\n\n(b) a provision of Subdivision B of Division 80 of the Criminal\nCode (treason);\n\n(c) a provision of Division 82 of the Criminal Code (sabotage),\nother than section 82.9;\n\n(d) a provision of Division 91 of the Criminal Code (espionage);\n\n(e) a provision of Division 92 of the Criminal Code (foreign\ninterference);\n\n(f) a provision of Part 5.3 of the Criminal Code (terrorism),\nother than section 102.8 or Division 104 or 105;\n\n(g) a provision of Part 5.5 of the Criminal Code (foreign\nincursions and recruitment);\n\n(h) section 6 or 7 of the repealed Crimes (Foreign Incursions\nand Recruitment) Act 1978.\nNote:\nA determination may be made in relation to a conviction for an\noffence against a provision specified in subsection (5) that occurred\nbefore the subsection commenced (see item 19 of Schedule 1 to the\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "068ec42a888e6f066e68764e2ba8acbb4b9259bcaf37f1e1ebcfaf3aeb3ebfe0",
      "skos:note": "Determination of citizenship cessation for certain convictions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020#sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36D(5) Citizenship cessation determination for certain convictions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the provisions are the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) a provision of Subdivision A of Division 72 of the Criminal\nCode (explosives and lethal devices);\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 88, 2020\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020\n\n(b) a provision of Subdivision B of Division 80 of the Criminal\nCode (treason);\n\n(c) a provision of Division 82 of the Criminal Code (sabotage),\nother than section 82.9;\n\n(d) a provision of Division 91 of the Criminal Code (espionage);\n\n(e) a provision of Division 92 of the Criminal Code (foreign\ninterference);\n\n(f) a provision of Part 5.3 of the Criminal Code (terrorism),\nother than section 102.8 or Division 104 or 105;\n\n(g) a provision of Part 5.5 of the Criminal Code (foreign\nincursions and recruitment);\n\n(h) section 6 or 7 of the repealed Crimes (Foreign Incursions\nand Recruitment) Act 1978.\nNote:\nA determination may be made in relation to a conviction for an\noffence against a provision specified in subsection (5) that occurred\nbefore the subsection commenced (see item 19 of Schedule 1 to the\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Cessation) Act 2020)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
