      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasObligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Has obligation to determine citizenship cessation",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "36D(6) Citizenship cessation determination for certain convictions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020#sch-1-sec-36d-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment\ndoes not include a suspended sentence; and\n\n(b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of\nboth an offence against a provision specified in\nsubsection (5) and in respect of one or more other offences,\nthen:\n\n(i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period\nof imprisonment relates to the offence against the\nprovision specified in subsection (5)—the person is\ntaken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect\nof that offence for that part of the total period of\nimprisonment; and\n\n(ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken\nto have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of\nthe offence against the provision specified in\nsubsection (5) for the whole of the total period of\nimprisonment.\nGeneral provisions relating to Minister’s powers",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment\ndoes not include a suspended sentence; and\n\n(b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of\nboth an offence against a provision specified in\nsubsection (5) and in respect of one or more other offences,\nthen:\n\n(i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period\nof imprisonment relates to the offence against the\nprovision specified in subsection (5)—the person is\ntaken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect\nof that offence for that part of the total period of\nimprisonment; and\n\n(ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken\nto have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of\nthe offence against the provision specified in\nsubsection (5) for the whole of the total period of\nimprisonment.\nGeneral provisions relating to Minister’s powers",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36d-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d9d0c53abc91a5eb438c6e6e39a32721e596ced17c25f44c6bf9b9be5bd72b06",
      "skos:note": "Clarifies the meaning of imprisonment for certain convictions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020#sch-1-sec-36d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36D(6) Citizenship cessation determination for certain convictions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment\ndoes not include a suspended sentence; and\n\n(b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of\nboth an offence against a provision specified in\nsubsection (5) and in respect of one or more other offences,\nthen:\n\n(i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period\nof imprisonment relates to the offence against the\nprovision specified in subsection (5)—the person is\ntaken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect\nof that offence for that part of the total period of\nimprisonment; and\n\n(ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken\nto have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of\nthe offence against the provision specified in\nsubsection (5) for the whole of the total period of\nimprisonment.\nGeneral provisions relating to Minister’s powers"
    },
