      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may determine in writing that a notice under\nparagraph 36F(1)(a) should not be given to a person if the Minister\nis satisfied that giving the notice could prejudice the security,\ndefence or international relations of Australia, or Australian law\nenforcement operations."
    },
