      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Minister does not revoke the determination within 5 years of\nmaking it, the determination is taken to be revoked at the end of the\n5 years unless the Minister extends the determination under\nsubsection (4).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the Minister does not revoke the determination within 5 years of\nmaking it, the determination is taken to be revoked at the end of the\n5 years unless the Minister extends the determination under\nsubsection (4).",
