      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If, before the determination is taken to be revoked under\nsubsection (3), the Minister remains satisfied that giving the notice\ncould prejudice the security, defence or international relations of\nAustralia, or Australian law enforcement operations, the Minister\nmay extend the determination for 1 year by making a determination\nin writing to that effect.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If, before the determination is taken to be revoked under\nsubsection (3), the Minister remains satisfied that giving the notice\ncould prejudice the security, defence or international relations of\nAustralia, or Australian law enforcement operations, the Minister\nmay extend the determination for 1 year by making a determination\nin writing to that effect.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36g"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36g-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36g-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2ce25686a840f21f6b5527921c02d82906157e3a1ac75fe5faedb29239ea27c5",
      "skos:note": "Extend determination for 1 year under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020#sch-1-sec-36g-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36G(4) Determination that notice of citizenship cessation should not be",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If, before the determination is taken to be revoked under\nsubsection (3), the Minister remains satisfied that giving the notice\ncould prejudice the security, defence or international relations of\nAustralia, or Australian law enforcement operations, the Minister\nmay extend the determination for 1 year by making a determination\nin writing to that effect."
    },
