      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the Minister extends the determination for 1 year under\nsubsection (4):\n\n(a) the Minister must consider whether to revoke the\ndetermination at least every 90 days after extending it; and\n\n(b) the determination is taken to be revoked at the end of that\nyear.",
