      "values:originalText": "initiative\n\n(1) The Minister may, on the Minister’s own initiative, revoke a\ndetermination made under subsection 36B(1) or 36D(1) if the\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36j-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
