      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 21,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If an event mentioned in subsection (1) occurs in relation to a\ndetermination, the person’s citizenship is taken never to have\nceased under section 36B or 36D (as applicable) because of the\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments"
    },
    {
