    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36l",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "36L No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under this",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020#sch-1-sec-36l"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "Subdivision\n\nIf a person ceases to be an Australian citizen under this\nSubdivision, Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply in relation\nto the person after that cessation.\nNote:\nThe effect of this section is that, unless a determination under\nsection 36B or 36D is revoked (see sections 36H, 36J and 36K), the\nperson can never become an Australian citizen again.",
      "skos:definition": "Subdivision\n\nIf a person ceases to be an Australian citizen under this\nSubdivision, Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply in relation\nto the person after that cessation.\nNote:\nThe effect of this section is that, unless a determination under\nsection 36B or 36D is revoked (see sections 36H, 36J and 36K), the\nperson can never become an Australian citizen again.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36l-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020-sch-1-sec-36l-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "56ed07587b7c5b65670921718847bfb72ac79dbf44736e5b9c53a2fe8767bd9a",
      "skos:note": "No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under this subdivision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-cessation-act-2020#sch-1-sec-36l",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36L No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under this",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "Subdivision\n\nIf a person ceases to be an Australian citizen under this\nSubdivision, Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply in relation\nto the person after that cessation.\nNote:\nThe effect of this section is that, unless a determination under\nsection 36B or 36D is revoked (see sections 36H, 36J and 36K), the\nperson can never become an Australian citizen again."
    },
    {
