      "values:originalText": "counter-terrorism and national security legislation)\nRepeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(aa) Subdivision C of Division 3 of Part 2 of the Australian\nCitizenship Act 2007 (citizenship cessation determinations)\nand any other provision of that Act as far as it relates to that\nSubdivision;\nIntelligence Services Act 2001",
      "skos:definition": "counter-terrorism and national security legislation)\nRepeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(aa) Subdivision C of Division 3 of Part 2 of the Australian\nCitizenship Act 2007 (citizenship cessation determinations)\nand any other provision of that Act as far as it relates to that\nSubdivision;\nIntelligence Services Act 2001",
