      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSection 36B of the amended Act applies in relation to conduct specified\nin any of paragraphs (5)(a) to (h) of that section, if:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nSection 36B of the amended Act applies in relation to conduct specified\nin any of paragraphs (5)(a) to (h) of that section, if:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendments",
